WEBVTT

NOTE Ty Farrago's remix. Times from Whisper word timings (Sept 28). The page plays the whole file, so the cues run to its end.
The cues after 17.66 s are the earlier caption text, retimed to the same word timings; the names spoken there are replaced with [name].

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:01.800
Who told you you could fish here?

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:04.000
I thought it was state property.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:04.850
State?

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:05.380
Yeah.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.000
This?

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:06.550
Yeah.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:07.250
State?

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:08.000
It ain't.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.220
Hit the road, dude.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.580
This ain't no state property.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.600
This is private property.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:13.100
Oh, okay.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:13.620
What is your name?

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.900
I want your name.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.660
So I can call down and see who gave you permission.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:18.160
My name.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.380
State property.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:20.300
My name [name].

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:21.400
Last name.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:22.400
[name].

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:23.800
[name].

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:24.200
Yeah.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.240
State property.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:27.600
I ain't never heard of that before in my life.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:28.840
Yeah.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.420
(upbeat music)
